    {"instruction": "Meanwhile, make the Broad Bean Couscous."},
    {"instruction": "Carefully transfer pork to a chopping board. Cover to keep warm. Strain pan juices into a small saucepan. Bring to the boil over medium-high heat. Reduce heat to medium. Simmer for 10 to 12 minutes or until sauce thickens. Transfer to a serving jug."},
